SUMMARY:ICWSM 2027 (est.) · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International AAAI Conference on Web and Social Media\nStatus: 
 estimated\, checked 2026-10-31. Check the organizer's call before relying
  on it.\nOfficial source: https://www.icwsm.org/2027/\nVenue Radar: https
 ://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#icwsm-2027\nNotes: 21st ICWSM (AAAI). O
 n 2026-10-31 the official site and AAAI page confirm Edinburgh but give n
 o dates or format\; May 26-29\, 2027 and in-person are one-year proxies f
 rom ICWSM 2026. Deadlines are official\, 23:59 AoE. Round 1 (May 15\, 202
 6) is not stored because only two paper-round types exist. January is the
  last round for 2027 (a January R&R moves to 2028) and the only one for p
 osters\, demos (not tracked) and dataset papers. Social Science and Socio
 physics track papers share full-paper deadlines but publish abstracts onl
 y. PCS portal not checked (login). Size M follows 186 papers in the 2026 
 program. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Complex Systems & Network Science,Natural Language Processing & 
 LLMs,Data Mining & Data Science
